{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id49762153"}, "name":{"label":"NetGifted"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-06-21T09:33:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5.5"}, "id":{"label":"2739768022"}, "title":{"label":"Great Markdown editor"}, "content":{"label":"I am an Ulysses user ready to change to Bear. Lot’s of export options though .docx is really bad we can reformat in Word, really lame job in this end. I love the themes and it syncs really well and fast across devices. I would like to have the possibility of opening folders on icloud or Dropbox but we are limited to import and export. The #tag system is robust and good. Overall a great app let’s see if I miss Ulysses...so far the IOS apps of bear are far superior. Great job!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id44063120"}, "name":{"label":"Widda27"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-06-19T14:20:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5.5"}, "id":{"label":"2727108366"}, "title":{"label":"I am in love <3"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been looking for something like this for years and I’ve finally found it. Simple and clean features for seamless organization and linking of notes, lists and whatever else you come up with. After years of struggling with Notes, OneNote and everything else out there, I’m happy I finally found my true love.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id209168168"}, "name":{"label":"eradicait"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-05-28T23:29:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5.5"}, "id":{"label":"2611120763"}, "title":{"label":"Great writing app, but would prefer one-time purchase"}, "content":{"label":"Bear is a great app for writing my notes and assignments. I love the feel of the app and the ability to tag entries/documents. You can access a lot of the app's features without having to pay, which I really appreciate.\n\nA lot of the additional themes look great, but I would not like to have to pay a subscription to use them. I would prefer to pay once (a couple dollars) to use a theme.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
