{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id22151332"}, "name":{"label":"Chambers"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-02-27T07:11:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.4.2"}, "id":{"label":"2252884388"}, "title":{"label":"Bear Pro User"}, "content":{"label":"Bear itself is the best note taking app for the Apple landscape of products. I use it daily on mobile and well as desktop and it is without a doubt, the best note product and upgrading to pro is a worthwhile investment. I’ve cancelled my Evernote subscription and haven’t looked back!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id86767017"}, "name":{"label":"BenEisBEST"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-02-14T15:23:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"2208622958"}, "title":{"label":"Good, but far from perfect"}, "content":{"label":"The writing experience is wonderful. A markdown notes app is just what I was looking for. \n\nThe annoying parts:\n• premium themes are boring and not worth paying for. It would be so much nicer if we could define our own themes, or if they just had some good themes to choose from! Like seriously it bothers me so much that all the dark themes are low contrast or not complementary coloured.\n• Exporting code snippets to a PDF is terrible. There are visible bugs in the PDF that look like ghost code snippets. Atrocious.\n\nDespite the pain I have with this app I will continue to support it. It’s really the best markdown note app out there and I hope that the community can shape its future. The price is steep now, but is worth the investment so long as updates keep coming in.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id413894493"}, "name":{"label":"poniesinjudah"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-02-07T17:31:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"2180016140"}, "title":{"label":"Not beautiful, tiny font"}, "content":{"label":"I don’t know why everyone says this app is beautiful. It’s not, there’s nothing special about it in terms of how it looks or how it’s organized. It has a strip of additional controls at the top of the keyboard that makes the writing area smaller. I think they’re controls for “markdown“ which in my world is not part of writing. Not a writing app. Just another word processor. And harder to use than Pages. The tagging to group things sounds useful. But the font is too small and you cannot change it. It’s tiny even if you have the text size setting on the iPad enlarged. If you put it in full screen mode to type it still starts 2 inches in from the side. It doesn’t have good design at all.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id33517886"}, "name":{"label":"zZzFalaecozZz"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-01-25T05:32:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"2125321212"}, "title":{"label":"Awesome"}, "content":{"label":"- Efficient tag system for classification and organization\n- Markdown system allow for real quick edits\n- Code block highlighting for a multitude of languages\n- Auto completion\n- Easy to stylize and fun to use\n\nLack of support for tables is the only drawback that I see but other than, it’s well worth the subscription fee.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id235151816"}, "name":{"label":"-52-vince"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-01-09T11:04:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.4"}, "id":{"label":"2072987146"}, "title":{"label":"Best note-taking app!"}, "content":{"label":"You can focus on the essential while taking and revisiting notes. Beautiful design. My favorite feature is that you can enter code snippets between notes, great tool for programmers or people studying computers!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
