{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id115410917"}, "name":{"label":"3btiller"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-11-26T08:19:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.2"}, "id":{"label":"1950593436"}, "title":{"label":"Good app but understand it’s major flaw!"}, "content":{"label":"Great app but they missed the boat big time.  This app is organized by tags and every note you create must contain a tag to identify where it’s filed.  For example if you tag a recipe #recipes/Indian/meat/2017  .... you must manually enter this tag for every note - NO AUTO-TAGGING.  If you happen to misspell or capitalize anything , it would creat a whole new tag.\n\nCrazy but true.\n\nTrust me, at the beginning it seems like it’s not such a big deal .... until you begin using the app more.   All users be aware.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id500469985"}, "name":{"label":"NervousChestnut"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-11-18T17:35:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.2"}, "id":{"label":"1931295314"}, "title":{"label":"Beautiful and simple"}, "content":{"label":"The Free version is good enough for me. Would like to see more flexible layout control ie. multicolumn, image placement...", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id236252410"}, "name":{"label":"Hbz125(@@)"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-11-14T17:51:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.2"}, "id":{"label":"1921597632"}, "title":{"label":"Best notes"}, "content":{"label":"Hands down best editor, runs circles around iOS notes and other notes apps, cheap subscription service completely worth it, looking forward to updates. Dark mode on notes is so hard to come by and that alone makes this app worth it but check out all the features. iPhone+Mac you definitely need this app", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id28360789"}, "name":{"label":"Senturion"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-10-20T07:31:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"1862157181"}, "title":{"label":"Superb"}, "content":{"label":"Edit: I am only editing this to express my supreme sadness at the fact that I’m now in a Windows-only environment at work and have to switch back to Evernote. :(\n\nI have been using Bear since beta and it's simply fantastic. \nI love the interface, the distraction free writing, and the added functionality when you need it. \nA few suggestions:\n1. Add a # shortcut to the keyboard toolbar \n2. Add an automatic day/night mode\n3. In the Mac app, add the ability to two-finger swipe between the three interface panes (tags, notes, writing)\n4. Export to Medium\n5. Ability to bulk edit tags (maybe Mac app only)\nHappy to pay for an upgraded experience.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
