{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id132512206"}, "name":{"label":"Laurilee222"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-09-30T16:33:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.5"}, "id":{"label":"1819604704"}, "title":{"label":"Best Writing App I Have Tried"}, "content":{"label":"I have tried several apps for my writing, but this one is the best yet! I switched from using Evernote and it doesn’t compare. I love using this app, it’s so handy, has so many features and I can keep my writings so easily organized. The only thing I wish it had was a way to access it online on a browser since I don’t yet have a Mac so I can’t connect between devices! Otherwise fantastic application!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
