{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id198150920"}, "name":{"label":"Zipadola"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-09-13T22:58:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.4"}, "id":{"label":"1789190055"}, "title":{"label":"Great standalone... lots of potential"}, "content":{"label":"It's a nice app. Great attention to detail like the slight vibrate when you delete or tick something off... makes to do lists feel more satisfying when you complete things. Also, nice clean interface. Very easy to use.\n\nThe downers which caused me to delete the app were lack of sync abilities to devices other than apple... and as I like bullet points and sub points... doing that wasn't as simple as it could be. \n\nFor the devs...On the right track towards striking a nice balance between doc making and note-taking. It would be great if sync could extend to non apple devices. Try to incorporate chart making abilities too if you're going to go as far as implementing code input.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id452608403"}, "name":{"label":"urok123"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-09-05T23:18:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.4"}, "id":{"label":"1776400150"}, "title":{"label":"Thrilled"}, "content":{"label":"I've just started using this app, but I love the way it is so easy to create a document from my phone. I can see the notes becoming small e-books and choose your own adventures.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id351349929"}, "name":{"label":"Hmsachs11"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-09-04T04:38:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.4"}, "id":{"label":"1772773949"}, "title":{"label":"Not good for simple to do lists"}, "content":{"label":"This app is not good if you're looking for a simple way to keep to do lists. \n\nIt advertised \"check box\" feature but once you download the app there's no option. I tried to research how to do this online and you need to be on a Mac to type in a short code to produce the checkbox. \n\nToo much work and time wasted. I uninstalled.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id6090449"}, "name":{"label":"KJBaril"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-08-30T21:39:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.4"}, "id":{"label":"1763018021"}, "title":{"label":"The best note taking app"}, "content":{"label":"I copied all my Notes into Bear - I imagine I'll copy my Evernote and One Note notes into Bear as well. It's so simple to use and the hashtag system makes organizing a breeze. I have hashtags for personal and business. It's fantastic!  So far...", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id100631758"}, "name":{"label":"zeke322"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-08-15T14:16:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"1729273823"}, "title":{"label":"Get this one."}, "content":{"label":"Better features. Better support. Better pricing and has Developers with integrity. If those features aren't important to you, get Ulysses.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id24134642"}, "name":{"label":"GeoEng51"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-08-14T01:07:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"1727055410"}, "title":{"label":"Beautiful interface; Elegant design"}, "content":{"label":"Bear is a pleasure to use - a note-taking app with a well thought out, elegant design, that is beautiful to look at and simple to use. Features such as support for the Markdown language and the use of tags to organize notes are really appreciated. After playing with this app for 15 minutes, I was hooked - and I'm sort of a note app junkie, so I don't say this lightly.\n\nThe implementation of syncing in Bear Pro is brilliant. No usernames and passwords needed, as Bear Pro is tied directly to your Apple ID. Just download the app on a new device and you are ready to go, with all notes automatically synched!\n\nThis app deserves the recent award from Apple and the subscription price for Bear Pro is entirely worth it. It is a great model to keep the developers developing and the app healthy!!\n\nThanks for a super, sophisticated but simple, elegant app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id109718816"}, "name":{"label":"Frenchhunter"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-08-12T05:09:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"1724494155"}, "title":{"label":"Super greater than Odysseus"}, "content":{"label":"I have used many writing apps, and journals and find the Bear far superior than any ever tried.  Even the bait and hook type that deceive the initial purchaser have condescended to put themselves out of the picture.  \nKeep up the good work Bear!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id147565751"}, "name":{"label":"Chris Meek"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-07-22T12:17:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"1693782930"}, "title":{"label":"Simple, Elegant, Powerful"}, "content":{"label":"I use the GTD system, and Bear combined with Things 3 and Fantastical 2 gives me everything I need. I use Bear as my Reference system - i.e for storing any information relating to any of my projects. I love the use of hashtags as a tagging system. Would highly recommend.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id48827777"}, "name":{"label":"edmondtw"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-07-05T18:58:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"1670521533"}, "title":{"label":"monthly subscription or no syncing"}, "content":{"label":"beautiful app, but after i spent time installing on all of my devices and learning how to use it, i found out that you cannot sync unless you pay a monthly subscription... syncing is a basic function nowadays, so basically it's a brick without it...\n\nif you use this for a year, it'll cost you a cool $24, and if it's useful, in 4 years you'll have paid a nearly $100 for the app, and the more you use it, the more that price goes up, not to mention they can increase that after they hooked you on. when was the last time you spent $100 on a note taking app? just nuts.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
